{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20351","headline":"病中寄白学士拾遗 · 张籍","name":"病中寄白学士拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋亭病客眠，庭树满枝蝉。\n凉风绕砌起，斜影入牀前。\n梨晚渐红坠，菊寒无黄鲜。\n倦游寂寞日，感叹蹉跎年。\n尘欢久消委，华念独迎延。\n自寓城阙下，识君弟事焉。\n君爲天子识，我方沉病缠。\n无因会同语，悄悄中怀煎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}